[{"time": 92.397, "text": "你在干嘛？！", "mode": 5, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "d11fb824"}, {"time": 81.401, "text": "游戏里还真有能变成精灵的魔法", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "e53d77fc"}, {"time": 41.694, "text": "游戏什么？", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "6b0a7db9"}, {"time": 92.212, "text": "这个感觉有点耗产能，现在最缺的就是产能，发布的时候没想到会爆火导致产能跟不上", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "66ca4efa"}, {"time": 39.527, "text": "买游戏什么", "mode": 5, "color": 16707842, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "e88397b"}, {"time": 77.475, "text": "对对对以后可以出个躲猫猫小游戏然后一堆人一起匹配在特定的区域里面找藏的人然后还能变成其他精灵", "mode": 1, "color": 15772458, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "88c9ba04"}, {"time": 96.073, "text": "?", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "29760073"}, {"time": 25.394, "text": "帕鲁？", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "cb25774b"}, {"time": 0.778, "text": "猜你在找方可梦模组", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "794c313d"}, {"time": 48.328, "text": "那我的世界方可梦捏", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "de1a9472"}, {"time": 0.0, "text": "", "mode": 1, "color": 16777215, "fontsize": 25, "user_hash": "<function Danmaku.crack_uid at 0x0000016E4A0849E0>"}]